  "solution": "<ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li><div class=\"with-figure\"><div><strong>Đúng</strong>.<br>Vì <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>M</mi></semantics></math> là trung điểm của cạnh <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> nên\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mi>.</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></semantics></math></div></div><div class=\"side-figure\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/2fee1f2c44be0f83ea596962779c8299e7c9517a6429f6130bf36155b67325d8.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div></div></li><li><strong>Đúng</strong>.<br>Vì <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>N</mi></semantics></math> là điểm trên cạnh <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></semantics></math> sao cho <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>N</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></semantics></math> nên\n\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mrow><mi>N</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>⇔</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⇔</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mi>.</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></semantics></math></div></li><li><strong>Sai</strong>.<br>Từ <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>, ta được\n\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"><mover><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn